+- **Trigger:** solver dispatch (Job 477792, cron 2026-10-30 08:45 +08), claim GRANT_NEW `2026-10-30T00:53:38Z`
+- **Lane:** report-only, keep-open. The owner receipt (below) already made the evaluate-lane decision; this dossier preserves the pre-reset saturation evidence, re-verifies the licensing facts live, and receipts an instrument gap that blocks the pre-registered 30-day trajectory. Closure stays with the verdict plane/admin.
+
+## 1. Owner receipt acknowledged (2026-10-29T22:23:44Z, issue comment by repo owner)
+
+The receipt decides the evaluate lane: immediate migration **rejected**; self-hosted **Valkey (BSD-3-Clause) remains the designated target** should chronic command saturation ever necessitate on-premise infrastructure; tracked under the long-term infrastructure roadmap. This dossier does not re-litigate that decision — it (a) records the last pre-reset state of the rotation chain, (b) re-verifies the licensing facts against official sources fetched live today, and (c) surfaces the gap between the pre-registered 30-day data criterion and the instruments actually running today, so the "data-driven revisit" the receipt promises has a start line.
+
